          "text": "Retried statuses: 429, 502, 503, 504 (any endpoint); 408 except on /models/instances/query; 409 only when the cdf-is-auto-retryable header is true. GraphQL HTTP 200 responses that carry both errors and data are also retried. Retry counts: up to 10 retries for 429, 5xx and 409 (MaxRetries); up to 2 retries for 408 and for GraphQL transient errors (MaxRetries408). Delay: exponential, base 1000 ms (2000 ms for 408 and GraphQL transient errors), doubled per retry, capped at 60000 ms, with jitter (random fraction of the base delay). The 200 ms /streams/ page pacing is not a retry.",
